  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado/GMC Sierra 150\n2020-2026 Silverado/ Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: YITAMOTOR side steps provide a suitable fit; Specifically designed fit for 2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500, 2020-2026 Silverado/ Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab\nUnmatched Strength: Crafted from high-strength stainless steel, these side steps are rust and corrosion resistant for stability and long-term durability; Each side supports up to 450lb and offers reliable assistance for all users\nOptimal Width: Our 6-inch wide side rails offer maximum stepping comfort as they feel sturdy and safe without being overly bulky.\nStylish Design: The aluminum nerf bars feature slip-resistant plastic step pads and a powder coat finish that exudes sharp look and long-lasting durablity\nEasy Installation: Our bolt-on step bars require no drilling or cutting for easy installation. All hardware and instructions are included. Just mount the brackets, slide the bolts to align, and tighten to finish\nProfessional installation recommended",
